:"3lis4","id":45194613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTk0NjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45194613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4","html_url":"https://github.com/3lis4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3lis4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-22T12:04:24Z","updated_at":"2025-03-22T12:04:24Z","body":"I completely agree with @Jules5, the current behavior forces us to do cumbersome and convoluted code to make a not-that-complex menu navigable with gamepad/keyboard. It would be much more intuitive to write/read code, and similar to how mouse inputs are handled, with what @Jules5  describes.\n@Sauermann said in #81499 we needed use cases to know if _gui_input propagation for keyboard/gamepad inputs would be useful or not. @Jules5 and I gave use cases, [see mine here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/81499#issuecomment-2034625861). With these use cases in mind, it seems now that it would be better to change the behavior #81499 over modifying the documentation #7899 (which was preferred at the time). Is there any argument against this ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2745238549/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]